{"tool_name":"worm-toolbox:-high.throughput-screening-of-c.-elegans","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"markdown","processed":"","summary":"","value":"This toolbox is a unique collection of workflow templates for high-throughput screening. 4 different workflow templates are presented in the documentation linked below. \r\n\r\n>..A toolbox for high-throughput screening of image-based Caenorhabditis elegans phenotypes. The image analysis algorithms measure morphological phenotypes in individual worms and are effective for a variety of assays and imaging systems. This WormToolbox is available through the open-source CellProfiler project and enables objective scoring of whole-worm high-throughput image-based assays of C. elegans for the study of diverse biological pathways that are relevant to human disease."}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-05-30T17:19:15+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2014-12-09T16:20:18+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4672,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"aa065b14-d8d2-4d0e-9c4c-346d54b15828","url":"/taxonomy/term/4672"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505205439,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Carolina W\u00e4hlby"},{"value":"Lee Kamentsky"},{"value":"Zihan H Liu"},{"value":"Tammy Riklin-Raviv"},{"value":"Annie L Conery"},{"value":"Eyleen J O'Rourke"},{"value":"Katherine L Sokolnicki"},{"value":"Orane Visvikis"},{"value":"Vebjorn Ljosa"},{"value":"Javier E Irazoqui"},{"value":"Polina Golland"},{"value":"Gary Ruvkun"},{"value":"Frederick M Ausubel"},{"value":"Anne E Carpenter"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4406,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"52610b56-c1e0-4e46-8153-204086050cb5","url":"/taxonomy/term/4406"},{"target_id":4673,"target_type":"ta